Based on LearnHarness
---------------------

Neuroplast is a modified version of LearnHarness by Amos Blomqvist:
https://github.com/amosblomqvist/learnharness
Ported from commit 0795ef197cca04f6a8e7d50d10ed4dc71bd1a0cc (2026-10-25).
LearnHarness is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License,
version 3 only (AGPL-3.0-only).

Modified by the Neuroplast contributors from October 2026 onward. The
learning engine was ported into one Next.js application and reorganized into
feature folders, and since then it has been changed and extended: scored
challenges with training and retakes, a skill-tree Knowledge view, the
warm-up, plan and lesson stages with their gates, the separate Learn and
Sessions spaces, Grok sign-in, and more. docs/learnharness-integration.md
maps the upstream code to its place here; the git history records each
change and its date.


